OL,3,GNEWSAThree arrested in Fife after
OL,4,Areport of firearm
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been arrested
OL,7,Ffollowing a report of people in
OL,8,Fpossession of a possible firearm in
OL,9,FFife.
OL,11,FPolice received a report of two men in
OL,12,Fpossession of what appeared to be a gun
OL,13,Fon Victoria Street in Ladybank at about
OL,14,F15:20.
OL,16,FOfficers, including firearms officers,
OL,17,Fwere called in and a firearm was
OL,18,Frecovered. Tthere were no injuries.
OL,20,FTwo men, aged 32 and 47, and a woman,
OL,21,Faged 28, have been arrested in
OL,22,Fconnectionn with the incident.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
